{
  "schema": 1,
  "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
  "runtime_enabled": false,
  "decision": "https://github.com/Oteryn/Oteryn-Game/pull/2843#issuecomment-6589517205",
  "npc_owner_question": "https://github.com/Oteryn/Oteryn-Game/pull/2843#issuecomment-6589624211",
  "purpose": "Pinned full dialogue and atomic native branches held for an approved owner; not a second NPC handler.",
  "npcs": [
    {
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "fragments": [
        {
          "line": 86,
          "literal_parts": [
            "May the Three-Fold Path guide your steps."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:86"
        },
        {
          "line": 94,
          "literal_parts": [
            "I welcome you, traveller of fate's unsearchable roads. On behalf of the {Merudri}, let this be an invitation from a humble guide along the way of enlightenment."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:94"
        },
        {
          "line": 97,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Congratulations, fortunate {seeker}. You are one step closer to becoming a true warrior {monk} and ready to leave this island. Let me hold you on your path."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:97"
        },
        {
          "line": 100,
          "literal_parts": [
            "I am glad you take your acquaintance, {seeker}. You must have a lot of questions for which I would gladly prove answers. If you are interested in joining us as a true warrior {monk}, just ask."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:100"
        },
        {
          "line": 107,
          "literal_parts": [
            "I am a {Merudri} ambassador. Sent from the heart of the {Blue Valley} I am stationed here to {guide} seekers on our path and {pilgrimage}.",
            "I have introduced myself as a guide: take my advice or choose a different path, you have every choice and every choice is yours. I can also provide assistance with magic {spells} for monks."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:107"
        },
        {
          "line": 115,
          "literal_parts": [
            "We are Merudri, warrior monks. Honing serenity, preserving our legacy, defending the {Blue Valley} and beyond."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:115"
        },
        {
          "line": 120,
          "literal_parts": [
            "The Blue Valley is our ancestral home and heart of the {Merudri} culture, or what is left of it. Our ancestors from the Valley have long been separated from the true home of the {Merudri}."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:120"
        },
        {
          "line": 125,
          "literal_parts": [
            "I am here to communicate the ways and customs of the {Merudri} on our path to serenity. Please let me know if you are interested in our {pilgrimage}."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:125"
        },
        {
          "line": 130,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Look for the four shrines around the outpost and return to me after you have honoured the Merudri."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:130"
        },
        {
          "line": 135,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Harmony, enlightenment and power are the keys and control is the door to true serenity."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:135"
        },
        {
          "line": 140,
          "literal_parts": [
            "This place has been the starting point for many generations of heroes. Try to focus on learning the basics here and return to me once you found our {shrines} and are experienced enough to take on the {pilgrimage}."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:140"
        },
        {
          "line": 145,
          "literal_parts": [
            "The shrines you can find here are part of the Three-Fold Path. They are the first stage of this {pilgrimage} that every {monk} must undertake."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:145"
        },
        {
          "line": 150,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Our Enpa is guiding us, a keeper of our {legacy} and spirituality. You will meet Enpa Rudra once you take on the pilgrimage."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:150"
        },
        {
          "line": 155,
          "literal_parts": [
            "The pilgrimage is the sacred Three-Fold Path every {monk} must go. Are you familiar with the {Merudri} ways of the {monks}?"
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:155"
        },
        {
          "line": 160,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Your path has led you to an ambassador of the Merudri. I am Manop and will do my best to explain you our {purpose}, legacy and role in it. Shall I continue?"
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:160"
        },
        {
          "line": 166,
          "literal_parts": [
            "I am glad you take your acquaintance, {seeker}. You must have a lot of questions for which I would gladly prove answers. If you are interested in joining us as a true warrior {monk}, just ask."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:166"
        },
        {
          "line": 179,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Like an orphan, fate has put your soul gently on the doorstep of a new world. You will view this reality with different eyes.",
            "You will change your ways to adapt as you follow the Three-Fold Path. It has guided the most powerful warriors across countless planes of existence to a higher state of consciousness.",
            "If you accept, I will send you to our temple in the Blue Valley as a MONK."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:179"
        },
        {
          "line": 186,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Look for one of our shrines around the outpost and return to me after you have honoured the Merudri."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:186"
        },
        {
          "line": 188,
          "literal_parts": [
            "You have honoured one shrine, seeker. There are three more waiting for you around the outpost. Keep walking the path."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:188"
        },
        {
          "line": 190,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Two shrines honoured, seeker. You are halfway there. Do not stop now."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:190"
        },
        {
          "line": 192,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Three shrines honoured, seeker. One remains. Find it and return to me."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:192"
        },
        {
          "line": 199,
          "literal_parts": [
            "You need to reach at least level 8 before you can become a monk."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:199"
        },
        {
          "line": 213,
          "literal_parts": [
            "You are now a pilgrim on the Three-Fold Path. Welcome to the Blue Valley, Seeker."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:213"
        }
      ],
      "source_sha256": "3b1bd3db14c3a19b93f6017f457388eefa75ec31ee1c8ace3f6d43c79cd70cb8"
    },
    {
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.enpa_deia_pema",
      "fragments": [
        {
          "line": 73,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Every warrior monk takes the three-fold path at least once. It is difficult but necessary. You may now visit the shrines to honor the Merudri legacy."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/enpa_deia_pema.lua:73"
        },
        {
          "line": 80,
          "literal_parts": [
            "You have honored our legacy! On behalf of all Merudri, I thank you, venerable traveler."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/enpa_deia_pema.lua:80"
        },
        {
          "line": 95,
          "literal_parts": [
            "You have already completed the pilgrimage and honored our legacy."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/enpa_deia_pema.lua:95"
        },
        {
          "line": 98,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Your pilgrimage is incomplete. You must visit all sacred shrines across Tibia to prove your dedication."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/enpa_deia_pema.lua:98"
        },
        {
          "line": 143,
          "literal_parts": [
            "Harmony, friend. Allow me to welcome you in the {Blue Valley}. I offer guidance for the {pilgrimage} and can provide {healing}. Or can I help you otherwise?"
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/enpa_deia_pema.lua:143"
        },
        {
          "line": 145,
          "literal_parts": [
            "May your path remain clear."
          ],
          "source": "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/enpa_deia_pema.lua:145"
        }
      ],
      "source_sha256": "d5f803179e213a87af296d1ecf8bcdbc33f5e4a299c0ece6c78242abb1c2c6a5"
    }
  ],
